menu "ECLIPS bridge"

    config ECLIPS_BIKE_ADDR
        string "Canyon unit Bluetooth address"
        default ""
        help
            Static random address of your "Canyon Power Supply", e.g. d9:73:cf:12:34:56.
            It is encoded in the ECLIPS QR code (Quick Start Guide / frame), and any
            BLE scanner (nRF Connect, bluetoothctl) shows it.

    config ECLIPS_BIKE_PASSKEY
        int "Pairing PIN"
        range 0 999999
        default 0
        help
            Last 6 digits of the ECLIPS system serial number (Quick Start Guide /
            frame). Leading zeros are dropped: 000123 -> 123.

endmenu
